<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka Loma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">LOMA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Loma valisonekele kuli Kanganda Paulu ha miaka ya mukati ka makumi atanu na iuana nakutuala ha miaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu na itatu (54-58) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Tele Paulu kanda aciye mukumeneka ku Loma kaha uatumine mukanda ou kushika vaka Kilistu mu Loma, kuli vaje Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda. Ou mukanda uausonekele tele acili mu nganda ya Kolinte muomu ha ntsimbu ije kukekuo kuakele nakukala. Paulu uasonekele linga mafuti oshe atsiliele nakuononoka Yesu Kilistu (16:26) Livulu lia Loma liapua livulu lia seho ku vaka Kilistu kuoshe na mu vintsimbu vioshe muomu ya muje mulialumbunuka muacili na muje mualitumbikilamo Paulu mukulumbununa muacili kuovoka cije kutuasa kukala naco kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu. Paulu naua uanungakanene Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu Kilistu ku Litavasano Lialaja. Vaka kulilongesa vavengi vakaliluisa nguavo cinimbu ca seho mu livulu eli capua 1:16 eci cihandeka nguaco, “Kunjivu shuamua ha Muzimbu Uacili, muomu ukeuo nzili ya Njambi ha kuovoka kuli uoshe uje atsiliela: ha kulivanga kuli Vayunda, kuhumaho kuli vaje keti Vayunda.” Mbazuvuila ya kulivanga ya Loma kuhuma (1-12) inahandeka cikuma via hali Njambi, kaha mbazuvuila ya mucivali kuhuma (13-15) ili na vishika viavingi ha vuyoye vua vaka Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu, mu mukanda uendi aputuka kuliambulula ikeye vavenia na ku vantu vaje vausonekelele (1: 1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako asoneka vuyoye vua muntu na kuovoka kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu (1: 16; 11:36)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hanima yevi Paulu ahana vishika via vuyoye vua Yesu (12: 1; 15: 13)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Uamanusuile Livulu lia Loma mukuhana vimeneka ku vantu va cikungulukilo ca Loma (16)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Yange Paulu, ngamba ya Yesu Kilistu na kanganda uje yahanguile nakunjisana kuli Njambi mukuambulula Muzimbu uendi Uacili.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Njambi uakulahesele laja Muzimbu Uacili kuhitila muli tunanguizi vendi, ngue muvanavisoneka mu Visoneka via Kulela. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Vinapu via Munendi, ngue ku vuyoye vuendi vua ha mavu, uasemukile ku ntanga ya Ndaviti, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />kuhitila muli Cimbembesi Uakulela Yesu vamusholuele na nzili yakama kupua Muna Njambi omo vamusanguile ku vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kuhitila muli Yesu tuatambuile kavumbi na vunganda linga tusane vaje keti Vayunda linga vononoke kulutsilielo muomu ya lizina liendi. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Kaha neni naua munapu vamo hakati kavaje keti Vayunda vaje vavanasana linga vakundame kuli Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Nankuma, njilina kusonekela kuli yeni voshe muli mu Loma vaje Njambi vazanga nakumisana linga mupue vantu vendi vakulela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale kuli yeni vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia kutsantsela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Cakulivanga, njitsantsela kuli Njambi yange kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu hali yeni voshe, muomu lutsilielo lueni lunatsimana ha mavu oshe. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Njambi ikeye mukaleho uange ngeci vioshe vije vinjilina kuhandeka vinapu via vusunga, Njambi uje injili nakupangela na mutima uange uoshe mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Munendi. Njambi nazivuka ngeci njikamivuluka, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />ntsimbu yoshe mu malombelo ange. Njikalombo nguange Njambi mu cizango cendi nga atava njije kuli yeni nakumimeneka. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Njishunguiya cikuma kumimona, linga njakumihaneko vuana vua mu Cimbembesi mukumikolesa. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Hano njilumbununa ngeci yeni nange tuakulikolesa ha ntsimbu imolika, yeni ha lutsilielo luange kaha nange ha lutsilielo lueni.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Vamuanetu, munapande kuvuluka ngueni vintsimbu viavingi njakele na vutumbe vuakuija oko nakumimeneka, vuno honi kuli cuma cimo cinanjivindika. Njitonda kukoka vantu hakati keni ngue munjinalingi hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Njilina likongo lia vipangi hakati ka vantu voshe, kuli Vangelengu na vaje keti Vangelengu, na kuli vaka kunangula na vilema. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Nankuma, njitonda cikuma kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili nakuli yeni naua muakala mu Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzili ya Muzimbu Uacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Kunjesi na shuamua ya kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili, muomu unapu nzili ya Njambi ije ineha kuovoka kuli vaje voshe vatsiliela, ha kulivanga kuli Vayunda, kaha naua na kuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Muomu mu Muzimbu Uacili mukemo vusunga vua Njambi vanavusholola kuhitila mulutsilielo ngue muvihandeka visoneka nguavio, “Muntu uje ivanapuisa muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi akayoya ha lutsilielo.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu voshe vali na mulonga ku mesho a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Vutenu vua Njambi vunasholoka kuhuma muilu nakuluisa vupi vuoshe na vilinga via kupihia via vantu vaje vilinga viavo viavipi vivindika vusunga linga keti vavuzivuke. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Muomu vije vineha nguavo linga vazivuke Njambi vinasholoka, muafua Njambi navisholola kuli vakevo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Hume haje Njambi hatangelele mavu, vifua viendi vije kutuasa kumona, nzili yendi ya yaye na cifua cendi ca Vunjambi vinasholoka muacili, vantu vasa kuvizivuka mu viuma vije vianalingi Njambi. Nankuma, vantu ava kuvasa kulikonela houe. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Cipue vene vazivukile Njambi, vuno honi kuva musingimikile cipue kumuhana citsantsela. Vuno honi visinganieka viavo vinapu viangoco kaha na mitima yavo yamupulungua inashulu na milima. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Vakahandeka nguavo vanapu vaka mana, vuno honi vanapu vilema, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />kaha vanalikela kulemesa uje kekutsa, nakulemesa viuma via vifua via vuntu vije kuviekuyoya miaka yoshe na vifua via tuzila cipue tusitu cipue viakulikoka.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Nankuma, Njambi navecelela linga valinge viuma via mazilo ngue ku mashungu a mitima yavo, kaha valinga viuma via shuamua kuli umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Vanaviana kutsiliela vusunga vua Njambi, kaha vanatsiliela makuli nakulemesa nakupangela vije vianatanga Njambi kuhona kulemesa vavenia uje uavitangele, uje ivanapande kushangazala miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Muomu ha cuma eci, Njambi navecela linga valinge viuma via shuamua ngue ku mashungu avo. Cipue vampuevo vanatenguluka kulinga vilika na vamala mu ngila ya cisemua, vuno honi valina kuvilinga mu vingila vije kuviapandelemo. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Kaha mu ngila imo naua vamala vanatenguluka kulinga vilika na vampuevo mu ngila ya cisemua, vuno honi valinakulinga vukoyi na vakuavo vamala. Vamala vali nakulinga viuma via shuamua kuli umo na mukuavo, kaha ha cuma eci vanatambula fueto inavapande muomu ya vilinga viavo viavipi vije vivanalingi.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Muomu vantu ava vanaviana kuniunga vusunga vua kuvuisisa Njambi mu viyongola viavo, Njambi navecelela linga vakale na mana a mapi, linga valinge viuma vije kuvapandele kulinga. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Vanashulu na viuma vioshe via mazilo na vipi na lizangamena na cizindo, vanashulu na cipululu nakutsiha na luozi na makuli na lizangamena. Vakafueye, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />nakuhandeka viavipi hali umo na mukuavo, vanapu vaka kuzinda Njambi, vaka likamba, vaka kulihalesa, kaha vaka kulipamba, vayongola vingila viavingi via kupangelamo vupi, kuve kuononoka visemi vavo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />kuve kuvuisisa, kuve kuniunga vikulaheso viavo, kaha kuve kumuesa ngozi cipue kuvuila vakuavo cikeketima. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Cipuevene vazivuka nguavo kusompa ca Njambi cihandeka nguaco vantu vaje vayoya mu ngila eyi vanapande kutsa, keti lika viuma evi vali na kutualelelaho kulinga houe, vuno honi naua vacilitavasana na vaje vaka kuvilinga.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Kusompa ca Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Yove kavusamba kange, nkuma ukasompo vakueni ndi? Kuli yove kukuesi kusambua, cipue vene yove iya. Nga yove usompa vakueni kaha ulinga viuma vije vivalinga vakevo, ulinakulihisa yove vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tuazivuka ngeci kusompa ca Njambi capua ca vusunga ha vantu vaje valinga viuma via vipi. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Nkuma omo yove, muntu lika, usompa vakueni kaha naua ukalingi viuma vije vivakalingi, uayongola nguove uasa kuputumuka ku kusompa ca Njambi ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Cipue ulinakukehesa ngozi yendi yakama na kulongua cendi na kusimpa cendi. Muavusunga uzivuka nguove Njambi uakala na ngozi muomu alinakueseka kukutuamenena linga utenguluke. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Vuno honi muomu ya mutima uove uakukola nakukaluua, kaha ulinakulingisa cihiso cove linga cipue cakama ha Litangua lije omo vutenu vua Njambi nakusompa cendi ca vusunga vikasholoka. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Njambi akahana vuana ku muntu na muntu kuya kuvipangi viendi vije vianalingi. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Vamo vantu vali nakutualelelaho kulinga muacili, nakutonda vumpau na kasingimiko na muono uje kuuekutsa, kuli vakevo Njambi akavahana muono uayaye ya yaye. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Vuno honi vamo vantu valizanga vakevo vavenia nakuviana via vusunga nakukava vije viakupihia, kaha Njambi akamuesa vutenu vuendi na matoto endi hali vakevo. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kukakala tuyando nalamba ku vantu voshe vaje valinga vupi, ha kulivanga kuli Vayunda kaha naua nakuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Vuno honi Njambi akahana vumpau na kasingimiko na ciyulo kuli voshe vaje valinga muacili, ha kulivanga kuli Vayunda kaha naua na kuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Muafua Njambi kakele nacivembulu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Vaje keti Vayunda vaje kuvesi na lishiko lia Mosesa, valinga vupi kaha vazimbala muomu cakuhona lishiko. Vayunda vaje vali na lishiko, valinga vupi kaha vavasompa na lishiko. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Muafua keti hakuvua lika lishiko lia Mosesa ngeci vantu vavapuisa vaka vusunga kuli Njambi, vuno honi vaje vononoka eli lishiko vaka vatumbula nguavo vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Cilivene vaje keti Vayunda kuvakele na lishiko lia Mosesa, vuno honi vioshe vivakalingi na mana aje muaya lishiko eli, vakevo vavenia vanapu lishiko liavo, cipuevene kuvakele na lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Cifua cavo cimuesa ngeci vije lishiko lia Mosesa lishika vanavisoneka mu mitima yavo. Kaha naua na vilinga viavo vimuesa ngeci viuma evi vinapu via vusunga, muomu vintsimbu vimo viyongola viavo vikavahisa kaha naua vintsimbu vikuavo vikavamena. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Kaha ngue kuya ku Muzimbu Uacili unjilinakuambulula, omu mukemo mucikafua ha Litangua lia Kusompa lije omo Njambi akahisa viyongola viavushueke via vantu voshe kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayunda na lishiko lia Mosesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Honi yove, nga ulitumbula yove vavenia nguove nji Kayunda, nga uajendamena ha Lishiko lia Mosesa nakulihalesa hali Njambi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />kaha unazivuka vika Njambi atonda linga uvilinge, kaha unalilongesa ku lishiko lia Mosesa kuhangula vije vinapu vusunga, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />kaha unazivuka muacili ngeci yove unapu ntuama ua tupuputua, naua ceke kuli vaje vali mu milima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />unapu umuka kusungamesa vilema, naua u mulongisi ua vaje vali kunzimba. Uazivuka muacili nguove mu lishiko lia Mosesa unauanamo mana akushula na vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Yove honi uje ukalongesa vakueni, nkuma vikahoni kulilongesela yove vavenia? Ukambulula nguove, “Keti muive.” Vuno honi yove vika ukevila? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Yove uje ukahandeka nguove, “Keti mulinge vupangala.” Nkuma yove ukalingi vupangala ndi? Yove uje uazinda tumponia, nkuma ukevi via mu vinjivo via kulemesela tumponia ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Yove uje ukalishasha ha lishiko lia Njambi, vuno honi nkuma kuuekuvuisa Njambi shuamua omo upokola lishiko liendi ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Muomu yeni Vayunda, nankuma, vaje keti Vayunda vashaula Njambi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Nga muononoka lishiko, kulovoka ceni cili na seho, vuno honi nga kumuononoka lishiko, mukapua cilivene ngue kumualovokele. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Nga vaje keti Vayunda, vaje kuvalovokele, vononoka vije lishiko lia Mosesa lilinakushika, nkuma Njambi kakavaniungu ngue vaka kulovoka ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Kaha yeni Vayunda vakamihisa kuli vaje keti Vayunda muomu mukapokola lishiko lia Mosesa, cipuevene vanamisonekelalio kaha naua muapua muvaka kulovoka, vuno honi vakevo valinakuononoka lishiko cipuevene kuvalovokele ku cisemua. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Munima yavioshe evi, nkuma iya Kayunda ua vusunga, uje uakulovoka muavusunga ndi? Keti muntu uje ikeye Kayunda hambanza lika, uje kulovoka cendi cinapu ca muvila lika. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Vuno honi Kayunda ua vusunga ikeye muntu uje Kayunda mukati, uje mutima uendi unalovoka, kaha eci cinapu cipangi ca Cimbembesi ua Njambi, keti ca lishiko liakusoneka. Muntu ua cifua eci Njambi amushangazala, keti vantu houe.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Nkuma Vayunda vanapulakana vaje keti Vayunda ndi? Cipue nkuma kulovoka cili na seho ndi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Cuma cakama cikuma mu vingila vioshe! Mu cihela cakulivanga, Njambi uakundikile lizi liendi kuli Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Vuno honi vatihoni nga vamo vavo kuvapuile vakulongua? Nkuma eci cilumbunuka ngue Njambi keti muka kulongua ndi? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Houe keti ngoco! Njambi napande kupua ua kulongua, cipue vantu voshe vapua vaka makuli. Ngue muvanavisoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Unapande kusholoka uakulongua omo uhandeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">unapande kuhiana mulonga uove omo vakusompa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Vuno honi nga vilinga vietu viakupihia vije vituli nakulinga visholola muacili vusunga vua Njambi, nkuma tuasa kuhandeka nguetu Njambi akalingi muamupi omo atuhana kashitiko ndi? (Njilinakuhandeka mucifua ca vuntu) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Houe keti ngoco! Nga Njambi keti ua kulongua, nkuma vatihoni asompa vaka mavu?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Vuno honi nga makuli ange amuesa vumpau vua Njambi hakusholola vusunga vuendi muacili, muomu vika naua hanga vacinjisompa ngue muka vupi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Nkuma vikahoni kumuhandekela ngueni, “Tulingeni vupi linga vucili vusholoke?” Cilivene, vantu vamo vali nakunjishaula nakunjivangeya nguavo njinahandeka cuma eci! Vakavahisa ngue mucinapandelamo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naumo uahi muka vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nkuma vatihoni yetu Vayunda tunapu tuvacili kupulaka Vangelengu ndi? Keti ngoco houe! Muomu njamilekele laja nguange Vayunda na Vangelengu voshe vali mu nzili ya vupi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ngue muvanavisoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Naumo uahi muka vusunga,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />naumo uahi ali na mana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">cipue muka kulemesa Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Voshe vanatenguluka kuhuma kuli Njambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">voshe vanalingi vupi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">naumo uahi akalingi cuma ca vusunga.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mezi avo anashulu na vusungu vua makuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">vindaka viavo vihandeka makuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">tunua tuavo tuhandeka mezi akupihia ngue vusungu vua linoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Handekesi yavo inashulu na visingo via kushasha.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Vakazambula kuvulumuna na kutsiha vakuavo,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />mu vingila viavo muli kupihisa na kunongesa.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ku vazivuka ngila ya ciyulo,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />kaha na mu mesho avo kuvekuvuila Njambi liova.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Honi tuazivuka ngeci viuma vioshe mu lishiko viakundama kuli vaje vali mu lishiko, mukuvindika kulikonela coshe ca vantu nakuneha vantu voshe kukusompa ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Muomu naumo uahi napu muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi mukulinga vije lishiko litonda, vipangi via lishiko vikevio vinapu kuleka yetu linga tuzivuke nguetu tu vaka vupi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muje vati Njambi natupuisa tu vaka vusunga ku mesho endi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Vuno honi ngila ya Njambi yakupuisa vantu linga vapue vaka vusunga ku mesho endi inasholoka. Kuyesi nacimo na lishiko, cipue lishiko lia Mosesa na tunanguizi vahanene vukaleho hali lishiko eli. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Vusunga vua Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo muli Yesu Kilistu kuli voshe vaka kutsiliela. Muomu kukuesi kahangu kahi, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />vantu voshe vanalingi vupi, kaha vakele kulahako na vumpau vua Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Vuno honi vana vapuisa vaka vusunga kuli Njambi ha vuana vua kavumbi ka Njambi kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu, uje navapatula. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Njambi uamupuisile nkombelo, linga ha nkombelo ya kutsa cendi akapue cihingo ca kukonekela vupi vua vantu halutsilielo luavo muli ikeye. Njambi ualingile cuma eci mukumuesa ngeci napu muka vusunga. Ha kulivanga Njambi uasimpile, kaha kahakeleko mutima ku vupi vua vantu, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />vuno honi ku ntsimbu ino alinakusompa vupi vua vantu, mukumuesa vusunga vuendi. Mu ngila eyi vene Njambi alinakumuesa ngeci ikeye vavenia napu muka vusunga kaha muntu uoshe uje atsiliela muli Yesu Njambi amupuisa muka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Nkuma honi kuli naua tukalishasha? houe vene! Nkuma muomu ya kuononoka lishiko ndi? houe, vuno honi muomu tutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Muomu tukayongola nguetu muntu vamupuisa muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha lutsilielo lika, vuno honi keti mukulinga vije lishiko vilishika. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Cipue Njambi nkuma uapua Njambi ua Vayunda lika ndi? Nkuma kapuile naua Njambi ua vaje keti Vayunda ndi? Cilivene uapua Njambi uavoshe. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Muomu Njambi uapua umolika, kaha akapuisa Vayunda kupua vaka vusunga ku mesho endi ha lutsilielo luavo nakupuisa naua vaje keti Vayunda navakevo linga vapue va vusunga kuhitila mu lutsilielo luavo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Nkuma eci cinalumbunuka ngeci halutsilielo tunaviana lishiko ndi? Houe keti ngoco, vuno honi tulina kukolesa lishiko.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca Avilahama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Nkuma vikahoni tuhandeka hali kukuluila yetu Avilahama, vika vialingiuile kuli ikeye? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Nga Avilahama vamupuisile muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha viuma vije vialingile, ngue ualishashele, vuno honi ikeye kalishashele ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Avilahama uatsilielelele Njambi, kaha muomu ha lutsilielo luendi, Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Muntu uje apanga atambula fueto, vuno honi fueto yendi kuvasa kuitumbula nguavo vuana, muomu inapu cuma cije napangela. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Vuno honi muntu uje natsiliela lika ha lutsilielo, keti ha vilinga viendi, kaha uje atsiliela kuli Njambi uje muka kukonekela muka mulonga kupua uakuhona mulonga, kunapu kutsiliela cendi kuje Njambi ayongola linga amupuise muka vusunga ku mesho endi. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Eci cikeco calumbunuine Ndaviti omo uahandekele ha vikuisulo via muntu uje Njambi namupuisa muka vusunga, kuakuhona cuma cimo cije calinga uje muntu,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Vakukuisula vantu vaje Njambi navakonekela ku vipi viavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">Vantu vaje vipi viavo vanavikonekela!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Uakukuisula muntu uje Muene kakamuanukila vipi viendi!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Nkuma kukuisula cije cahandekele Ndaviti cakundama lika kuli vaka kulovoka ndi? Cilivene houe! Cinakundama naua nakuli vaje vaka kuhona kulovoka. Muomu tunamono laja mu visoneka nguavio, “Avilahama uatsilielelele kuli Njambi, kaha muomu ya lutsilielo luendi Njambi uamupuisile muka vusunga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Nkuma ntsimbu mukahoni cuma eci calingiuile? Nkuma eci calingiuile tele Avilahama kanda alovoke ndi? Houe tele kanda alovoke. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Vamulovuele, kaha kulovoka cendi capuile cimueso cakumuesa ngeci muomu ya kutsiliela cendi Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga ntsimbu kanda vacimulovole. Nankuma, Avilahama napu ishe ua voshe vaka kutsiliela kuli Njambi, kaha Njambi navatambula kupua vaka vusunga, cipue vene kuvalovokele. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Kaha ikeye naua napu ishe ua voshe vaje vanalovoka keti lika kuli vaje vanalovoka vuno honi linga vavuezeleleko mukulovoka, vayoye yoyesi yakutsiliela ije yayoyele tatetu Avilahama ntsimbu kanda alovoke.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikulaheso ca Njambi vacitambula ha lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Omo Njambi uakulahesele Avilahama na vatekuluila vendi ngeci vakasuana mavu, ualingile eci, keti ngue Avilahama uononokele lishiko houe, vuno honi uatsilielele, kaha Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Muomu nga vije viakulahesele Njambi vavihana kuli vaje vononoka lishiko lia Mosesa, kaha lutsilielo lua muntu lupua luangoco, naua kaha cikulaheso ca Njambi cinapu cakuhona seho. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Muomu lishiko lineha vutenu vua Njambi, vuno honi nga kukuesi lishiko, kaha kukuesi kupokola lishiko.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Nankuma, cikulaheso cajendamenene ha lutsilielo, linga cikulaheso vapande kucikolesela kupua vuana vua Njambi kuli vatekuluila voshe va Avilahama, keti lika kuli vaje vononoka lishiko houe, vuno honi naua na kuli vaje vatsiliela ngue mualingile Avilahama. Muomu Avilahama napu tatetu ua voshe vaka kutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njinakupuisa ishe ya mafuti oshe.” Nankuma, cikulaheso cinapu cacili ku mesho a Njambi, uje yatsilielele Avilahama, Njambi uje muka kusangula vatsi, uje hakushika cendi aneha viuma vije kuviesiko linga vikaleko. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Avilahama uatsilielele nakukala na lutsilielo, cipuevene kukuakele cuma catsilielele, kaha uapuile “Ishe ya mafuti oshe.” Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Nankuma, vatekuluila vove vakapua vavengi cikuma ngue vintanga ntanga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Avilahama ha ntsimbu ije uakele na miaka yakupua cihita cimolika (100), vuno honi lutsilielo luendi kuluazeyele omo uayonguele ha muvila uendi uje uakele kuyehi na kutsa, cipue ha cuma cije ngeci Sala kasa kusema vana. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Kataliangelele mukutsiliela cendi, kaha kakele na kulinienga ha cikulaheso ca Njambi, vuno honi uatsilielele cikuma kaha uashangazalele Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Uatsilielele nguendi Njambi asa kulinga vije vianamukulahesa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Omu mukemo Avilahama ha lutsilielo luendi, vamupuisile muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Mezi aje ahandeka nguauo “Vamupuisile muka vusunga,” kuva asonekelele kuli ikeye lika houe. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Va asonekelele naua nakuli yetu kupua vaka vusunga, vaje vanatsiliela kuli Njambi uje uasanguile Muene uetu Yesu ku vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Vamuecelele linga atse muomu ya vipi vietu, kaha uamusanguile linga vatupuise vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kutupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Nankuma, muomu vanatupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo, kaha tuli mu ciyulo na Njambi hali Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Hali ikeye natulingisa linga tuzivuke kavumbi ka Njambi, kaje tuli nakuyoyelamo hano. Kaha tulina kulihalesa ha kutsiliela kua vumpau vua Njambi! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Keti lika ovio vuno honi tuli nakulihalesa ha tuyando tuetu, muomu tunazivuka nguetu tuyando tusholola lukakateya, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />kaha lukakateya lupuisa muntu linga apue ua vilinga viacili, kaha evi vilinga vineha kutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Kaha kutsiliela eci kucasa kutuvuisa shuamua, muomu Njambi netila cizango cendi mu mitima yetu kuhitila muli Cimbembesi Uakulela, uje ikeye napu vuana vua Njambi kuli yetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ha ntsimbu ije tuapuile tuvakakuzeya, Kilistu uatsililile vaka vupi ha ntsimbu ije yahanguile Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Cinapu cuma cacikalu cikuma kuuana muntu atava kutsila muka vusunga. Cipuevene nguavo casa kupua cacasi kuuana muntu uje atava kutsila muntu uacili. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Vuno honi Njambi nasholola cizango cendi cakama kuli yetu, omo ha ntsimbu ije tuapuile tuvaka vupi kaha Kilistu uatutsililile! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Vanatupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi muomu ya maninga endi, nankuma cikahiana cikuma Kilistu kutuamena ku vutenu vua Njambi! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Tuapuile vitozi va Njambi, vuno honi tunapu vavusamba vendi kuhitila ha kutsa ca munendi. Kaha honi muomu tunalikonekela na Njambi, tukovoka ha muono ua Kilistu! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Vuno honi keti evi lika houe, tujolela muomu ha vije vianalingi Njambi kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, uje hano honi natunehesa kulikonekela na Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kuhitila muli Andama na Muono kuhitila muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Vupi vuezile hano ha mavu kuhitila mu muntu umolika, nankuma vupi vuendi vuanehele kutsa. Kaha kutsa kuezile ku miyati yoshe ya vantu muomu voshe vanalingi vupi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Vupi vuakele ha mavu ntsimbu kanda vahane lishiko, vuno honi kuje kukuakele lishiko, vupi kuvavutandelako. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Vuno honi kuhuma ku ntsimbu ya Andama nakuheta ku ntsimbu ya Mosesa, kutsa cayulile ha vantu voshe, cipue hali vaje kuvalingile vupi ngue mualingile Andama omo kononokele lishiko lia Njambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Andama uapuile cimueso ca uje akeja. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Vuno honi vuana vuje kuvuapuile ngue vupi, muomu vuana vua Njambi kuvuapuile ngue vupi vua Andama houe. Muavusunga vene vantu vavengi vanatsi muomu vupi vua muntu umolika. Vuno honi kavumbi ka Njambi kakama cikuma, kaha na vuana vuendi vuakuhona kupangela vuje vuanahana ku vantu vavengi mu kavumbi ka muntu uje umolika, ikeye Yesu Kilistu vunapu naua vuakama cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Vuana vua Njambi kuvasa kuvusetekesa ngue vupi vua muntu umolika. Hanima ya vupi vumolika, kuezile “Kusompa,” Vuno honi hanima ya vipi viavingi, kuneja vuana vuakuhona kupangela! <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Muavusunga kuhitila mu vupi vua muntu umolika kutsa cayulile muomu ya uje muntu umolika. Vuno honi viuma vije vinasholoka vialingile uje muntu umolika, ikeye Yesu Kilistu vinahiana cikuma! Voshe vaje vanatambula kavumbi ka Njambi ka miaka yoshe ya yaye vanavapuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho endi vakayula mu muono kuhitila muli Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Nankuma, ngue ha vupi vumolika vantu voshe vanavahisa, mu ngila eyi vene cipangi cimolika ca kulongua cinapatula vantu voshe nakuvahana muono. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kaha ngue vantu voshe vavapuisile vaka vupi hakuhona kuononoka ca muntu umolika, mu ngila eyi vene voshe vakavapuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha kuononoka ca muntu umolika.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Lishiko liasholokele linga vilinga via vupi vilane, vuno honi kuje kuvualanene vupi, kavumbi ka Njambi kalanene cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Nankuma, ngue omo vupi vuayulile ha kutsa, mukemo vene naua kavumbi ka Njambi kalinakuyula ha vusunga, nakututuamenena ku muono uayaye kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu Muene uetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Tunatsi ku vupi vuno honi tuyoya muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Nkuma vikahoni tukahandeka? Nkuma tunapande kutualelelaho kuyoya mu vupi ngeci kavumbi ka Njambi kalane ndi? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Houe keti ngoco! Tunatsi ku vupi, nkuma vati naua tuasa kuyoyelamo? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Muomu muavusunga munazivuka ngueni omo vatumbuitikile hamo muli Kilistu Yesu, vatumbuitikile naua hamo namu kutsa cendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Kaha hakutumbuitika, tuatsile hamo nendi kaha vatutsindile hamo nendi, ngeci, ngue omo Kilistu vamusanguile ku vatsi na vumpau vua Ishe, ngeci netu tunapande kuyoyela mu muono uauha.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Muomu nga tunapu hamo nendi mu kutsa cendi, mu ngila eyi vene tukapua hamo nendi ha kusanguka cendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Kaha tuazivuka nguetu vuntu vuetu vualaja vavushukikile hamo na Kilistu ha cilindakano, ngeci muvila ua vupi vaunongese, ngeci keti tupue naua tu vandungo va vupi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kaha omo tutsa, vatupatula ku nzili ya vupi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Muomu tunatsi na Kilistu, tutsiliela nguetu tukayoya naua hamo nendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Muomu tuazivuka nguetu Kilistu uasangukile ku vatsi kaha kakatsi naua houe, kutsa kucesi na nzili naua hali ikeye. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Kaha muomu ikeye uatsile, kakatsiho naua ku vupi, kaha honi alinakuyoyela muli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Mu ngila eyi vene munapande kuvuluka ngueni munatsi ku vupi, vuno honi muli nakuyoya muli Njambi muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Keti mutave vupi vuyule mu mivila yeni ije kuye kuyoya yaye, mukononoke mashungu auo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Cipue vilio vieni keti muviecelele ku vupi mukuvipangesa mu viuma via vuhenge vuno honi likundikeni kuli Njambi, ngue vantu vaje vavahumisa ku kutsa nakuvaneha ku muono, kaha kundikeni vilio vieni vioshe kuli Njambi ngeci vavipangese mu viuma via vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Vupi kuvuapandele ku miyula houe, muomu kumuesi nakuyoya ku Lishiko lia Mosesa houe vuno honi, mu kavumbi ka Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandungo va vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Nkuma tukahandeka vikahoni? Nkuma tunapande kulinga vupi, muomu kutuesi ku Lishiko lia Mosesa vuno honi tuli mu kavumbi ka Njambi ndi? Houe keti ngoco.<verse eid="ROM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Muavusunga muazivuka ngeci omo mulikundika yeni vavenia ngue vandungo kukuononoka muntu umo, munapu mu vandungo va uje muene imuli nakuononoka, cipue ku vupi vuje vuneha kutsa, cipue hakuononoka, kuje kuneha kumipuisa vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Vuno honi tutsantsela kuli Njambi! Muomu cipue laja muapuile mu vandungo va vupi, muononoka na mitima yeni yoshe mu vusunga vuli mu vilongesa vije vimuatambuile. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Kaha vamipatuile ku vupi, munapu vandungo va vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />(Njilinakulikuasesa mezi amasi ku akuata muomu kuzeya ca mitima yeni ya vuntu) Kaha ha ntsimbu imo mua likundikile vutuntu kupua vandungo va viuma via mazilo na kapenga. Kaha mu ngila eyi vene hano vene munafuila kulikundika muva mutuntu kupua vandungo va vusunga ngeci mulinge viuma via kulela. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Omo muapuile vandungo va vupi, vusunga kuvuakele nakumituamenena. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Nkuma vikahoni muauaneneho hakulinga viuma vije vimuli nakuvuila shuamua? Fueto ya viuma vije inapu kutsa! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Vuno honi vanamipatula ku vupi, kaha munapu vandungo va Njambi linga mulele kaha mukale na muono uayaye. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Muomu fueto ya vupi inapu kutsa, vuno honi vuana vua Njambi vunapu muono uayaye muli Kilistu Yesu Muene uetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca vulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Vamuanetu, muavusunga muasa kuvuisisa evi vinjihandeka kuli yeni, muomu yeni voshe muazivuka Lishiko lia Mosesa. Lishiko lia Mosesa lili na nzili hali vantu omo valinakuyoya lika. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Mpuevo uakushomboka vanamukutu na Lishiko kuli yaliendi, omo yaliendi ali nakuyoya, vuno honi nga yaliendi atsa, kaha honi uje mpuevo napatuka ku Lishiko lije lia mukutile kuli yaliendi. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kaha nga uje mpuevo akala na yala ueka naua omo yaliendi acili na kuyoya, kaha vamutumbula nguavo muka vupangala, vuno honi nga yaliendi atsa, kaha akashomboka kuli yala ueka naua, ou mpuevo napatuka kapu naua muka vupangala. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Vamuanetu, neni naua cifua cimo, neni naua mu natsi ku lishiko muomu munapu vilio via muvila ua Kilistu, kaha honi munakundama kuli ikeye, uje ivasanguile ku vatsi linga tupangele Njambi vipangi viacili. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Muomu tuayoyele mu vusitu, mashungu a vupi aje Lishiko lia Mosesa liashangumuine akele nakupanga mu mivila yetu, kaha vioshe vitualingile viatutuelele ku kutsa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Vuno honi, tunapatuka ku Lishiko lia Mosesa, muomu tuatsile ku cije catupuisile vinzinda. Kutuesi naua nakupanga mu ngila ya laja ya Lishiko lia Mosesa lia kusoneka, vuno honi mu ngila yaiha ya Cimbembesi.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko lia Mosesa na vupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Nkuma tunapande kuhandeka nguetu Lishiko likelio liapua vupi ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Vuno honi liapuile Lishiko lije lianjilingisile linga njizivuke vupi. Nga Lishiko lia Mosesa kuliahandekele ngualio, “Keti uliveyele cuma ca mukueni,” Nga ku njazivukile lishungu eli. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Vuno honi vupi vua uanene muhela mukushangumuna mashungu a vupi amengi muli yange. Nga Lishiko kuliakeleko, nga vupi kuvuesi na nzili. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Nange vene ha ntsimbu imo njayoyele kuakuhona Lishiko, vuno honi omo lishiko liezile, vupi vuakele na nzili, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />kaha njatsile. Kaha Lishiko lije liapandele kuneha muono, lianehele kutsa kuli yange. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Vupi vuauanene muhela, kaha mu nzili ya lishiko vupi vuanjikuisile na kunjitsiha.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Lishiko lia Mosesa likelio liapua lia kulela, naua na Lishiko liapua lia kulela na vusunga vuacili. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Vuno honi nkuma eci calumbunuka ngeci cije cacili cikeco canehele kutsa kuli yange ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Eci calingiuile muomu vupi, hakupangesa cije cacili, vupi vuanehele kutsa kuli yange, linga cifua cavuo cisholoke ngeci muavusunga vunapu vupi. Kaha mu nzili ya lishiko vupi vunasholoka kupua vua vupi cikuma.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzita mukati ketu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tuazivuka nguetu Lishiko lia Mosesa liapua liaku cimbembesi, vuno honi yange njinapu muntu ua muvila ua ntsitu, uakulandesa ngue ndungo ku vupi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Kunjizivuka vinjilinga, muomu kunjekulinga vije vinjitonda kulinga, vuno honi njikalingi vije vinjazinda. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Kaha omo nga njilinga vije kunjatondele kulinga, eci cimuesa ngeci Lishiko lia Mosesa linapu lia vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Kaha keti yange vene muavusunga njili nakulinga viuma evi, vuno honi vupi vuje vuli nakuyoya muli yange. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Muomu njazivuka nguange kumuesi vucili muli yange, eci cikeco mu vuntu vuange. Cipue vene yange njila na lishungu liakulinga via cili, vuno honi ku njasa kuvilingamo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Muomu kunjekulinga vucili vuje vunjikatondo kulinga, vuno honi njikatualelelaho kulinga vupi. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Nga njilinga cije kunjatondele kulinga, eci cinalumbunuka ngeci keti yange njilinakucilinga, vuno honi vupi vuje vuli muli yange vukevuo vulinakucilinga.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Nankuma, njinauana nguange Lishiko lia Mosesa likelio lilinakupanga, omo njitonda kulinga via cili, kaha haje vene vupi vusholoka. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Muomu njivuahelela mu Lishiko lia Njambi mukati ka mutima uange. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Vuno honi njimona Lishiko lieka lilinakupanga mu muvila uange, Lishiko lije lilinakuluisa Lishiko lije linjinatsiliela mu mutima uange. Linanjipuisa cinzinda ca Lishiko lia vupi lije lilinakupanga mu muvila uange. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Yange muntu uakuvindama! Nkuma iya honi akanjamena ku muvila ou unjituala ku kutsa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Njitsantsela kuli Njambi hali Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kaha, mukemuo munjinapu, yange likani ngue njasa kupangela Lishiko lia Njambi na mutima uange uoshe, vuno honi vuntu vuange vupangela Lishiko lia vupi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Muono mu Cimbembesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Kukuesi cihiso kuli vaje vali na kuyoya muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Muomu Lishiko lia Cimbembesi, lije litunehela muono muli Kilistu Yesu, linanjipatula ku lishiko lia vupi na kutsa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Njambi ualingile vije lishiko lia Mosesa liahonouele kulinga. Muomu vuntu vuapuile vua kuzeya, Uahisile vupi mu vuntu ha kutuma Munendi, uje uezile mu cifua ngue cetu ca vuntu, mukuhumisa vupi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Njambi uapangele eci ngeci vilinga via vusunga vua Lishiko lia Mosesa vavishulise muli yetu vaje vavali nakutuamenena mucimbembesi, keti mu vuntu houe. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kaha omo vaje vanapu vaka vuntu, vayongola viuma via vuntu, vuno honi vaje vanapu vaka Cimbembesi, vayongola viuma via Cimbembesi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Nga cizango ca vuntu cikutuamenena, kaha fueto yaco kutsa vuno honi nga cizango ca Cimbembesi cikutuamenena, kaha fueto yaco inapu muono na ciyulo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Muntu uje akatonda via vuntu akempuka citozi ca Njambi, muomu akaviana kukavangeya mashiko a Njambi, muavusunga vene kakaononoka. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Kaha voshe vaje vali nakuvatuamenena ku vuntu kuvasa kuvuahelesa Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Kumuekuyoya ngue muje vuntu vutonda linga muyoyemo, vuno honi muyoya ngue muje Cimbembesi mu citondelahamo, nga Cimbembesi ua Njambi akala muli yeni. Uoshe uje kesi na Cimbembesi ua Kilistu, kaha kakundama kuli Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Vuno honi nga Kilistu ali muli yeni, cipue vene mivila yeni ikeyo inapu ya kutsa muomu vupi, vuno honi vimbembesi vieni vilinakuyoya muli yeni muomu vanamipuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Nga Cimbembesi ua Njambi, uje uasanguile Yesu ku vatsi, akala muli yeni, kaha uje uasanguile Kilistu ku vatsi ikeye naua akahana muono ku mivila yeni ya kutsa ha Cimbembesi cendi uje ali muli yeni.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Vamuanetu kutuapandele ngue kuyoyela mu vuntu ngue muvuatonda vuntu vuetu houe. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kaha nga muyoya ku vupi vua vuntu mukatsa, vuno honi nga ku Cimbembesi mutsihia vilinga via muvila ua vupi vua vuntu, kaha mukayoya. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Muomu voshe vaje Cimbembesi ua Njambi alina kuvatuamenena vanapu vana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kaha Cimbembesi uje yanamihana Njambi uamipuisile mu vandungo linga mukale na liova, vuno honi Cimbembesi uje namipuisa vana va Njambi, kaha na nzili ya Cimbembesi tulina kutambeka kuli Njambi nguetu, “Tate! Tatetu!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Cimbembesi ua Njambi nalitavasana na Cimbembesi uetu ngeci tunapu tuvana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Nga tuvana kaha tunapu tuvasuana, vasuana va Njambi hamo na Kilistu nga cilivene tulipangela hamo mutuyando tuendi cilivene tukalipangele hamo naua namu vumpau vuendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vumpau vua kulutue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Yange njasinganieka nguange tuyando otu tutuli nakuyanda ntsimbu ino kutuasa kutuseteka na vumpau vuje vukasholoka kuli yetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Nankuma, viakutanga vioshe vili na cizango cakama ca kuvandamena Njambi ngeci asholole vana vendi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Muomu viakutanga vioshe vavihisile ngeci vipue viuma viangoco, keti ngue ku cizango cavio houe, vuno honi capuile cizango ca Njambi linga cipue ngacije. Vuno honi cipue ngocovene kuakele kutsiliela, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />nga viakutanga ku litangua limo vikapatuke ku vundungo vua kutsa, kaha vukakale na vumpau vuakupatuka kua vana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Muomu tuzivuka nguetu kuheta na ku ntsimbu ino, viakutanga vioshe vili nakulikemanga ngue mpuevo uje atonda kusema. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Vuno honi keti viakutanga lika vili nakulikemanga houe, netu naua tuli na Cimbembesi ngue vaje vakulivanga kupua vana va Njambi ngeci atupuise vana vendi nakupatula mivila yetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Muomu tunovoka muafua ha kutsiliela, vuno honi kutsiliela cije kutumona kukeko keti kutsiliela, nkuma iya honi ali nakutsiliela vije vianamono? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Vuno honi nga tuli na kutsiliela vije kutuamuene, kaha hanga tucivandamena nakusimpa.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Mu ngila eyivene Cimbembesi atukuasa mukuzeya cetu. Muomu kutuzivuka muje vati tunapande kulombela vuno honi Cimbembesi ikeye akalambelela kuli Njambi na mezi akulikemanga aje kutuasa kutumbula. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Kaha Njambi uje amona mu mitima yetu, azivuka muviafua visinganieka via Cimbembesi muomu Cimbembesi akalambelela kuli Njambi hali vantu vendi ngue ku cizango cendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tuzivuka nguetu mu viuma vioshe Njambi akalingi muacili na vaje vamuzanga, kaha navaje vanasana ku cizango cendi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Kaha vaje vahanguile laja Njambi vakevo naua vatepele kuvapuisa ngue Munendi, linga Munendi apue uakulivanga kusemuka ha vavengi vaka kutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Kaha vaje vatepele Njambi, vakevo vasanene, vaje vasanene, uavapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi, kaha vaje vapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi vakevo vahanene vumpau vuendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Njambi muli Kilistu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ha viuma vioshe evi, nkuma tukahandeka vikahoni? Nga Njambi napu uetu, nkuma iya honi asa kutuluisa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Njambi kavianene kuhana Munendi umo lika, vuno honi uatueceleleye yetu voshe! Uje uatuhanene Munendi, nkuma kasa kutuhana viuma vioshe ndi? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nkuma iya honi asa kuvangeya vaje vanahangula Njambi? Njambi ikeye muka kuvapuisa vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nkuma iya asa kuvahisa? Keti Kilistu Yesu, uje uatsile, cipue uje ivasanguile ku vatsi kaha ali ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi, mukutulambelelako kuli Njambi! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nkuma iya asa kutuhangununa ku cizango ca Kilistu? Nkuma tuyando indi vukalu, nkuma mapakeso indi njala, nkuma kuhutua indi vushonde, indi kutsa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Muomu ya lizina liove tuli mu vushonde vua kutsa ntsimbu yoshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">valina kutupangesa ngue vampanga vaje vaya mukuvatsihia.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Houe, mu viuma vioshe yetu tunahiana muli ikeye uje uatuzangele! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Muomu njazivuka nguange muavusunga nacimo cahi casa kutuhumisa ku cizango ca Njambi, cipue kutsa cipue muono, cipue tungelo cipue vaka kusuana, cipue vaka nzili vaje vakala muilu, cipue ku ntsimbu ino vene cipue ku ntsimbu ya kulutue, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />cipue cuma cili muilu, cipue cuma cili ha mavu, nacimo cahi cakutanga casa kutuhumisa ku cizango ca Njambi cije cinapu cetu kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu Muene uetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Njambi na vantu vendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Njihandeka vusunga muli Kilistu Yesu, kaha kunjesi nakuhandeka makuli. Visinganieka viange lelo vilinakuambulula hamo nange hali Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />kaha omo njikahandeka nguange njili na vusiua vuakama cikuma, nakuvavala cije kucasa kuhua mu mutima uange, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />njayonguele nguange njakele mu cisingo ca Njambi na kulitepa kuli Kilistu muomu ya vantu vange. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Kaha ava vanapu vaka Isaleli, vaje Njambi uapuisile vana vendi mukuvasholuela vumpau vuendi, ualingile litavasano navo nakuvahana Lishiko lia Mosesa, vakalemesa mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha vanatambula vikulaheso via Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Kaha vanapu vatekuluila va vakukuluila vakutsimana, na Kilistu mu vuntu vuendi, nakundama ku cisemua cavo. Njambi uje muka kuyula viuma vioshe, vamushangazale miaka yoshe! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Kunjesi nakuhandeka nguange cikulaheso ca Njambi cinahonoua, muomu keti vantu voshe Vaisaleli vapua vantu va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Keti voshe vatekuluila va Avilahama vapua vana va Njambi houe. Vuno honi Njambi uahandekele kuli Avilahama nguendi, “Kuhitila muli Isake mukemuo lika mukakala na vatekuluila vaje njamikulahesele.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Eci calumbunuka ngue vana vaje vasemuka ku cisemua ca vuntu keti vana va Njambi, vuno honi vantu vaje vanasemuka muomu cikulaheso ca Njambi vakevo vavatumbula vatekuluila va vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Muomu Njambi uashikile Avilahama na mezi aua nguendi, “Mungolosika ha ntsimbu inovene njikahiluka naua, kaha Sala akasema muana ua yala.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kaha keti eci lika houe. Vuno honi muomu vana va Lambeka va vamala vakele na ishavo umolika, ikeye kukuluila yetu Isake. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Omo kanda vaje vampasa vasemuke naua tele kanda valinge viacili cipue viavipi, linga cizango ca Njambi cakuhangula citualeleleho, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />kaha Njambi ualekele Lambeka nguendi, “Mukuluntu akapangela shongo yendi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njazangele Yakomba, na kuzinda Isau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Nkuma vikahoni tukahandeka, nkuma Njambi uakahangu ndi? Houe keti ngoco. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Muomu Njambi uahandekele kuli Mosesa nguendi, “Njikovuila cikeketima hali uoshe uje njikazanga, kaha njikevuila ngozi hali uoshe uje injitonda kuvuila ngozi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Nankuma viuma vioshe kuvikundama kuli vije viatonda muntu cipue vije vialinga houe, vuno honi ha cikeketima ca Njambi lika. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo Njambi uahandekele kuli muene ua Ingito nguendi, “Njakupuisile muene linga njikupangese mukusholola nzili yange na kunjitsimanesa ha mavu oshe.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Nankuma Njambi ali na cikeketima hali uoshe yatonda, kaha akaluuisa mitima ya uje uoshe yatonda.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutenu vua Njambi na cikeketima cendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Kaha nga umo ueni akanjihula nguendi, “Nkuma nga omu mukemo mucinafu, kaha Njambi asa kutupaya vati? Nkuma iya asa kuviana cizango ca Njambi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nkuma yove, yove iya kavusamba kange, linga ulikumbulule na Njambi? Ndeho ya vuma kuyasa kuihula muntu uje uaishongele nguayo, “Nkuma vika uanjimungila muje?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Nkuma uje muka kushonga vindeho kesi na nzili yakupangesa vuje vuma muoshe muatondela ndi? Nkuma kasa kushonga vindeho vivali ha citapu cimolika ca vuma, ndeho imo yakupangesa viuma via seho, kaha ndeho ikuavo yakupangesa viuma viangoco ndi?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Kaha eci cinapu cavusunga ha vije vianalingi Njambi. Njambi uatondele kumuesa vukalu vuendi nakumuesa nzili yendi. Vuno honi uasimpile nakuyanda hali vaje uatalele na vukalu, vaje uafuililile kunongesa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Kaha naua Njambi uatondele kumuesa vumpau vuendi vuakama, vuje vuamuaniene hali yetu vaje amuesa cikeketima, yetu vaje vanavuahesa linga tutambule vumpau vuendi. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Muomu tunapu vana vaje vanasana, keti lika hakati ka Vayunda houe, vuno honi naua na hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Evi vikevio Njambi uahandekele mu livulu lia Hosiya nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Vantu vaje kuvapuile vange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Njikavasana ‘Vantu vange.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">vantu vaje kunjazangele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Njikavasana nguange, ‘vanjazanga.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Kaha ku cihela kuje kuvavalekele nguavo, ‘Keti mu vantu vange,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Kukekuo kuje vakavasana nguavo vantu va Njambi ua kuyoya.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Kaha Isaya uahandekele hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, “Cipue vene nga vantu Vaisaleli vanalana ngue museke ua ku cikuma ca cisali, vuno honi vaje vavandende vakasalaho vakevo vakovoka. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Muomu Muene akasompa vuasi vuasi vantu voshe va hano ha mavu ntsimbu imolika nakumanusula.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ngue muje muahandekele Isaya ha kulivanga nguendi, “Nga Muene muka nzili yoshe ngue katusezeleleko vatekuluila, ngue tunapu ngue Sondoma na Ngomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaleli na Muzimbu Uacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Nkuma vikahoni tukahandeka? Tukahandeka nguetu vaje keti Vayunda vaje kuvalipuisile vakevo vavenia vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, vavapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi ha lutsilielo, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />tele kanda vantu va Njambi vaje vatondele Lishiko lia Mosesa linga livapuise vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, kuvaliuanene. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Nkuma vikahoni? Muomu kuvajendamenene ha lutsilielo vuno honi hali vije vivalingile. Kaha vatsuntsukile ha “livue lia kutsuntsukisa.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Tala njikahaka livue mu Siyone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Lije likatsuntsuisa vantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Livue lije likavauisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Vuno honi uoshe uje atsiliela kuli ikeye kakovu shuamua.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Vamuanetu, vinjitonda cikuma mu mutima uange na lilombelo liange kuli Njambi vinapu ngeci vantu vange vovoke! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Yange njinapu mukaleho uavo muomu vakevo vapua vaka kulihana cikuma kuli Njambi, vuno honi kulihana kuavo keti kua mana a vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Muomu kuvazivukile ngila ije yakapuisa Njambi vantu linga vapue vaka vusunga ku mesho endi, vuno honi vakevo vaneseka kupangesa ngila yavo vavenia, ngeci, kuvalihanene vakevo vavenia ku ngila ya Njambi ije yikapuisa vantu linga vapue vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Muomu Kilistu ikeye mamanusuilo a Lishiko lia Mosesa, linga uoshe uje atsiliela vamupuise muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuovoka cinapu ca voshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mosesa uasonekele evi hakupuisa muntu linga apue muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha kuononoka Lishiko nguendi, “Uoshe uje ononoka Lishiko akayoya.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Vuno honi visoneka vihandeka hakupua muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha lutsilielo vikevio evi nguavio, “Keti ulihule yove vavenia nguove, nkuma iya honi akaya muilu?” (Cinapu ngue uli nakushuluisa Kilistu ha mavu) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“Cipue keti ulihule yove vavenia nguove nkuma iya akaya ku vukalo vua vatsi?” (Eci cinapu ngue uli nakuhumisa Kilistu ku vatsi) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Evi vinjili nakuhandeka vikevio evi, “lizi lia Njambi lili muyehi nove, lili mukanua kove na mu mutima uove” likelio, lizi lia lutsilielo lije tuli nakuambulula. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Nga ulitavela na kanua kove nguove Yesu ikeye Muene nakutsiliela mu mutima uove nguove Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi, ukovoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Muomu ha lutsilielo luetu mukemo vanatupuisa vaka vusunga, hakulitavela cetu mukemo tunovoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Uoshe uje akatsiliela muli ikeye kakevu shuamua.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Kukuesi kahangu hakati ka Vayunda na Vangelengu, muomu Njambi uje umo lika ikeye vene Muene ua voshe, kaha akakuisula cikuma voshe vaje vasana ha lizina liendi. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Uoshe uje akasana lizina lia Muene mu kumukuasa akovoka.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Nkuma vatihoni vakasana lizina liendi linga avakuase nga vakevo kuvatsilielele? Nkuma vati vakatsiliela nga kuvovuile lizi? Nkuma vatihoni vakevua lizi nga kuvaliambuluile? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Nkuma vakambulula vatihoni lizi nga tunganda kuvavatumine? Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Cinapu cakuvuahelela cikuma omo tunganda vakeja nakuneha Muzimbu Uacili!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Vuno honi keti voshe vanatambula Muzimbu Uacili. Isaya vavenia alinakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, nkuma iya uatsilielele vije vivovuile kuli yetu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Nankuma lutsilielo lukahumu hakuvua lizi, kaha na kuivua lizi likahumu hakuambulula via Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Vuno honi njihula nguange, muavusunga nkuma kuvovuile lizi ndi? Cilivene valiuvuile, muomu ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Mutambi ua lizi liavo uashandokelele ha mavu oshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Mezi avo ahetele naku ntsongo ya mavu oshe.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kaha njihula naua nguange, nkuma vantu Vaisaleli kuvevuisisile ndi? Mosesa ikeye vavenia uapuile uakulivanga kukumbulula nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Njikapangesa vaje keti Vayunda vaje vakuhona seho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">linga vantu vange vakovue cipululu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Njikapangesa vaje keti Vayunda vakuhona mana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">linga vakanienguese vantu vange.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kaha Isaya nakusimpa uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Vanjiuanene vaje kuvanjitondele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">njasholokele kuli vaje kuvanjihuile.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Kaha Isaya uahandekele naua hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, “Ntsimbu yoshe njikolola mavoko ange mukutambula vantu vaje vakuhona kuononoka na vaje vaka kunjiluisa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Cikeketima ca Njambi ku vaka Isaleli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Kaha njihula nguange, nkuma Njambi naviana vantu vendi ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Nange vene njapua njika Isaleli, mutekuluila ua Avilahama, uaku muyati ua Mbenjemani. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Njambi kavianene vantu vendi, vaje vahanguile kuhuma hambangelo. Yeni muazivuka ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka mu mutambela uje uhandeka hali Eliya uje ualiniengele kuli Njambi hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Muene, vanatsihi tunanguizi vove, kaha vanasihula mitula yove, yange lika njinasalaho kaha naua vali na kutonda kunjitsiha.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nkuma Njambi uamukumbuluile nguendi vika? “Njalitumbikila vamala vakupua makulukazi atanu na avali (7,000) vaje kanda valemese kamponia ka Mbale.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Nankuma, cinapu cuma cimo vene, vuavuno ku civunga ca cindende ca vantu vanasalaho vaje vahanguile Njambi muomu ya kavumbi kendi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Kuhangula cendi cinajendamena ha kavumbi kendi, keti ngue ha vije vivanalingi houe. Muomu nga kuhangula ca Njambi caya ngue kuli vije vivanalingi vantu, ngue kavumbi kendi kukapuile kavusunga. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Nkuma vatihoni? Vantu Vaisaleli kuvauanene cije vakele nakutonda. Capuile lika civunga cacindende ca vantu vaje vahanguile Njambi vakevo vaciuanene, kaha vaje vasaleleho vapuile tusinda matuitui kukusana ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njambi navahana cimbembesi cakuhona kulitavasana, na mesho akuhona kumona na matuitui akuhona kuvua nakuheta kuli litangua lialelo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Kaha Ndaviti ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Viuano viavo vipue miheto yavo, kaha vatsemo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">vanapande kuua, vanapande kuvazangamesa!<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Mesho avo apue a vupuputua linga keti vamone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">kaha vakotame miongo yavo mu tuyando tuavo ntsimbu yoshe.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Nankuma njihula nguange, omo Vayunda vatsuntsukile, nkuma vauile nakunonga ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Muomu valingile vupi, kuovoka kuneja kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga Vayunda vavovuile cipululu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Kaha vupi vua Vayunda vuanehele vikuisulo viakama ha mavu, kaha kuhutua kuavo kua mu Cimbembesi kuanehele vikuisulo viakama kuli vaje keti Vayunda. Nkuma cikafua vati kulana ca vikuisulo nga vayunda vavengi vakalivuezelela.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuovoka kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Njili nakuhandeka honi kuli yeni vaje keti Vayunda. Hakupua njikanganda ua vaje keti Vayunda njilinakulihalesa mu vipangi viange. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Hamo njasa kulingisa vantu vaku muyati uange cipululu, linga njase kuovolako vamo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Nga kuvaviana cavo canehele kulikonekela kuvaka mavu. Nkuma cikafua vatihoni nga vanavatambula? Cikapua ngue vanahana muono ku vatsi!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Nga mbazuvuila yakulivanga ya mbolo vaihana kuli Njambi, nankuma, namukasha uoshe uamutuntu unapu uendi naua, nga mizi ya muti vaikombelela kuli Njambi, kaha na mintango naua inapu yendi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Vuno honi nga mintango imo ya ku muti ya olive yakukuna vanaihojolako, kaha muntango ua olive ua mu musenge vanainungiyako. Kaha yeni keti Vayunda munapu ngue muti uamu musenge ua olive, kaha honi mulipangela cimbembesi ca vuyoye vua Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Nankuma, kumuapandele kuyengula vaje vavahojuele ngue mintango. Nkuma vatihoni muasa kulihalesa? Yeni munapu lika mu mintango, kumue kukuata mizi, vuno honi mizi ikeyo ili nakumikuata.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Vuno honi yeni muhandeka ngueni, “Eyo, muomu ije mintango vaihojuele ngeci vanjinungileko yange.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Eci cinapu ca vusunga. Vavahojuele muomu kuvatsilielele, vuno honi yeni muatumamene mu cihela ceni muomu munatsiliela. Vuno honi keti mulihalese ha visinganieka evi, munapande kulikolesa kaha mukale na liova. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Nga Njambi katetela Vayunda vaje vanapu ngue mintango ya cisemua, nkuma musinganieka ngueni akamitetela ndi? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Hano tumona ngozi ya Njambi nakukaluua cendi. Ikeye napu uakukaluua kuli vaje vanau, vuno honi napu muka ngozi kuli yeni nga mutualelelaho mu ngozi yendi. Vuno honi nga kumulingi ngoco, kaha neni naua vakamihojolako. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Nga Vayunda vakaseza kuhona kutsiliela cavo, kaha vaka vahiluisila naua mu mutambela muje muvakele, muomu Njambi asa kulinga ngacije naua. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Yeni keti Vayunda munapu ngue muntango ua muti ua olive uamu musenge uje uvanahojola, kaha ngue keti mucifua cauo, vuno honi vanaunungila ku muti ua olive uakukuna. Vayunda vanapu ngue uje muti uakukuna, kaha cikapua cacasi cikuma kuli Njambi kunungilako eyi mintango ivanahojuele ku muti uayo naua.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikeketima ca Njambi ku vantu voshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Vamuanetu kuli vusunga vua vushueke vuje njitonda linga muzivuke, muomu vukamivindika kusinganieka ngueni munapu vakuzangama. Eci kukaluua ca mitima yeni vantu Vaisaleli keti ngue ku miaka yoshe houe, vuno honi cikakalako mu kantsimbu lika kuvanga noho vaje keti Vayunda vanapumo kuija kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Omu mukemo vantu Vaisaleli voshe muva kavamena. Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Muyoyesi akahuma ku Siyone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">kaha akahumisa vupi vuoshe kuvatekuluila va Yakomba.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Kaha njikalitavasana navo litavasano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">eli omo njikahumisa vupi vuavo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Muomu vanaviana Muzimbu Uacili, kaha ava Vayunda vanapu vitozi va Njambi muomu yeni keti Vayunda. Vuno honi muomu ya kuhangula ca Njambi vanapu va vusamba vendi muomu ya vakukuluila vavo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Muomu Njambi kekutengulula visinganieka viendi kuli vaje nahangula na kukuisula. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ngue hali yeni keti Vayunda, kumuononokele Njambi kuntsenkulu, vuno honi vuavuno munatambula cikeketima ca Njambi muomu yakuhona kuononoka ca Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Mucifua cimo vene, muomu ya cikeketima cimunatambula, Vayunda honi kuvesi nakuononoka Njambi linga navakevo vatambule cikeketima ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Muomu Njambi napuisa vantu voshe vinzinda vakuhona kuononoka, linga amuese cikeketima kuli voshe.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushangala Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Vufuko vua Njambi vuapua vuavuingi cikuma! Kuzivuka cendi na mana endi viapua viakulova cikuma! “Nkuma iya honi asa kulumbununa matumbe endi?” <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Nkuma iya honi azivuka mana a Muene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Nkuma iya honi asa kumunangula?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Cipue nkuma iya honi uamuhanene cuma cimo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">linga amuhiluisile fueto?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Muomu ikeye uatangele viuma vioshe, kaha viuma vioshe vilinakuyoya muli ikeye na hali ikeye. Kuli Njambi kukale vumpau ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Vuyoye mukupangela Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Nankuma, vamuanetu muomu cikeketima ca Njambi cakama cikuma kuli yetu, njimilambelela nguange, lihaneni yeni vavenia kuli Njambi ngue nkombelo yakuyoya, likundikeni ku vipangi viendi na kumuvuahelesa. Eci cikeco kulemesa ca vusunga cije munapande kulinga. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Keti mulipuise ngue mu vantu vahano ha mavu, vuno honi eceleni Njambi atengulule visinganieka via mu mitima yeni. Ambahoni mukazivuke cizango ca Njambi, vije viacili nevi vimuvuahelesa nevi via kusungama.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Muomu njinatambula vuana vua kavumbi ka Njambi, njihandeka kuli yeni voshe nguange, keti musinganieke yeni vavenia kupua vakama cikuma kupulakana muje mumunafu. Vuno honi, munapande kulikehesa muvisinganieka vieni, lihiluleni yeni vavenia ngue ku lutsilielo lueni luje lua namihana Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Tulina vilio viavingi mu muvila umo, kaha cimo na cimo cili navipangi viaco. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Mucifua cimo vene, cipue tunapu tuvavengi, tunapu muvila umolika muli Kilistu kaha yetu voshe vanatunungu ku vilio via muvila umolika. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Nankuma, tunapande kupangesa vuana vuetu vuakuliseza seza ngue ku kavumbi ka Njambi, kaje natuhana. Nga vuana vuetu vunapu vuakuambulula vunanguizi, kaha tunapande kuambulula vunanguizi kuya ngue na lutsilielo luetu tuli naluo, <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />nga vuakupangela, kaha tunapande kupanga vene, nga vuakulongesa, tulongeseni vene, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />nga vuakukolesa vakuetu, kaha tunapande kulinga ngoco vene. Uoshe uje muka kuhana vakuavo napande kuhana na mutima umo, kaha uje uoshe muka nzili napande kupanga cikuma na nzili, uoshe uje amuesa ngozi kuli vakuavo napande kucilinga na kuvuahelela.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via cizango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Cizango cinapande kutungukua. Zindeni viuma vioshe vije vinapu viavipi, kakateyeni kuli vije viacili. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Lizangeni umo na mukuavo, kaha lisingimikeni umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Nankuma pangeni cikuma na nzili keti mupue vilenda. Pangeleni Muene nakulihakako na mutima uoshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Vuaheleleni mukutsiliela ceni, pueni vaka kusimpa mu tuyando tueni, kaha lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Lipangezeleni vije mulinavio navakueni vaka Kilistu vaje vana honoua, tambuleni vangenzi mu vinjivo vieni.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Vezikiseni vaje valina kumiyandesa, eyo, vavezikiseni, kaha keti muvasinge houe. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Vuaheleleni navaje valina kuvuahelela, lileni navaje vali nakulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Yoyeni mu litavasano umo na mukuavo. Keti mulihalese, vuno honi likeheseni mu vipangi. Keti musinganieke yeni vavenia ngue munapu vaka kuzangama.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nga umo nakupihisila, keti umuhiluisile vupi vuendi naua. Lingeni viacili ku mesho a vantu voshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Lingeni viuma vioshe ngue mu mumuhasela nakuyoya mu ciyulo ku muntu na muntu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Keti muhiluisile vupi ku vupi, vuno honi eceleni vukalu vua Njambi vucilinge. Muomu visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Yange njikahiluisila vupi, njikavahiluisila fueto yavo, muanahandeka Muene.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Vuno honi ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Nga citozi cove ali na njala, muhane viakulia, nga ali nampuila, muhane mema anue, muomu hakulinga eci ulina kumulingisa ngeci ovue shuamua.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Keti mutave vupi vumihiane, vuno honi hianeni vupi na viuma viacili.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kusingimika vaka nzili yakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Muntu uoshe napande kuononoka kuli vaka nzili yakama, muomu naumo uahi asa kushika kuvanga Njambi namuhangula, kaha vaka nzili yakama vaje valiko Njambi ikeye navahakaho. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Nankuma, uoshe uje aluisa vaka nzili yakama kaha naluisa na vije via nashiki Njambi, kaha uoshe alinga evi alinehela kusompa ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Muomu vaka kulinga muacili kuvasa kuvuila liova vaka kuyula, vuno honi kuvanga vaje valinga mua mupi. Nkuma yove kuvuila liova muntu uje alina nzili yakama ndi? Nankuma linga muacili kaha na ikeye akakushangazala, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />muomu vanapu vangamba va Njambi valina kumipangela viacili. Vuno honi nga ulinga mua mupi, kaha vovuile liova, muomu nzili yavo yaku kuzangamesa inapu ya vusunga. Vakevo vanapu vangamba va Njambi, kaha valina kuneha kuzangamesa ca Njambi kuli vaje valinga mua mupi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Nankuma ha cuma eci munapande kuononoka ku vaka nzili yakama, keti ngue hakuzangamesa ca Njambi lika houe, vuno honi naua muomu ha visinganieka viacili.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Eci cikeco naua mulina kufuetela lisimu, muomu vaka nzili yakama vali nakupangela Njambi nga vashulisisa vipangi viavo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Nankuma fueteni vije vinapu viavo, vafueteni lisimu lieni neli lia ku vufuko vueni, kaha mueseni kasingimiko kuli ava voshe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulizanga umo na mukuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Keti mukale nalikongo kuli umo na mukuavo, likongo munapande kukala nalio linapande kulizanga umo namukuavo. Uoshe uje azanga mukuavo kaha nononoka lishiko. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mashiko nguauo, “Keti ulinge vupangala, keti utsihe, keti uive, keti uliveyele cuma camukueni.” Kaha vioshe evi, navieka naua, vanavipuisa lishiko limolika nguavo, “Zanga mukueni ngue mu ualizanga yove vavenia.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Nga uzanga mukueni, kaha ku ukasa kumulinga mua mupi, nankuma, kuzanga, cikeco kuononoka lishiko lia Mosesa lioshe.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Yeni munapande kulinga ngacijevene, muomu munazivuka ngueni ntsimbu inahete ya kuhinduka mutulo. Muomu ntsimbu ya kutuovola ilimuyehi kupulakana muje muyakele omo tuatsilielele ha kulivanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Vutsiki vuavuno vuhua, litangua vuavuno lituhuka. Tuyeni tulikele kulinga viuma vije viakundama ku milima, kaha tuambateni vitua viakulua navio mu mutania. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tuendeni muacili, ngue vantu vaje valina kuyoya muceke ca mutania, keti kulinga kalua ka kuviuano cipue kupenda, cipue kulinga vupangala, cipue lizangamena, cipue kulinga luozi cipue cipululu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Vuno honi zaleni vitua via Muene Yesu Kilistu, keti muvuilile naua cifua ceni ca vuntu na kukavangeya mashungu aco houe.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Keti usompe vakueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Tambuleni vaje vanazeye mu lutsilielo, vuno honi keti mulinge vimpata navo ha visinganieka viavo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />lutsilielo lua vantu vamo luvatavesa kulia nkala cuma, vuno honi vantu vamo vaje vanazeye mulutsilielo valia lika visapa sapa. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Muntu uje alia vioshe keti ayengule muntu uje ke kulia vioshe, kaha uje alia lika visapa sapa keti asompe uje alia nkala cuma, muomu Njambi ikeye namutavesa. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Nkuma yove iya honi linga usompe ngamba yambala? Kuvanga uje Muene yavo ikeye ahangula nga valinga muacili cipue vanahonoua. Muomu Muene yavo akavakolesa linga vase.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Vantu vamo vasinganieka ngue litangua limo lili naseho kupulakana matangua akuavo, kaha vakuavo naua vasinganieka nguavo matangua oshe apua hamolika. Muntu na muntu napande kukolesa mu visinganieka viendi ngeci viapua viacili. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Uoshe uje asingimika seho ya litangua limo alisingimika muomu ya kusingimika Muene, uoshe uje alia ntsitu cuma napande kuyilia mukusingimika Muene, muomu akahana kutsantsela kuli Njambi. Voshe vaje vaviana viakulia vimo vaviana kusingimika Muene, kaha atsentsela kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Naumo uahi hali yetu aka liyoyela ikeye vavenia, kaha naumo uahi hali yetu akalitsila ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Nga tuyoya, tulina kuyoyela kuli Muene, kaha nga tutsa, tutsila kuli Muene. Nankuma, cipue tuyoya cipue tutsa, tunakundama kuli Muene. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Omo Kilistu uatsile, kaha uayoyele naua mukupua Muene ua vaka kuyoya na vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Nankuma, kuli yove ukali lika visapa sapa, nkuma vikahoni usompela mukueni? Kaha naua yove ukali vioshe, muomu vikahoni uyenguila mukueni? Yetu voshe tukemana ku mesho a Njambi na kutusompesa. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Muomu va visoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Muavusunga omo njiyoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">vantu voshe vakatsikama ku mesho ange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kaha vantu voshe vakalitavela nguavo yange Njambi.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Nankuma, yetu voshe, tukahandeka vietu vavenia ku mesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keti utsuntsuise mukueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Nankuma tueceleni kulisompa umo namukuavo. Vuno honi uapande kusinganieka linga keti uhake citsuntsuiso mu ngila ya mukueni cipue cakumuuisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Muvumo vuange muli Muene Yesu muavusunga njizivuka nguange kukuesi viakulia viakuhona kulela halika liavio, vuno honi nga munatsiliela linga viakulia vimo vinapu viakuhona kulela, nankuma, vipua viakuhona kulela kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Nga uvulumuina vakueni muomu ya cakulia, kuuesi nakumuesa cizango houe. Keti utave viakulia vije viulia vinongese muntu uje yatsililile Kilistu! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Nankuma, keti utave vije viunazivuka nguove viacili ku mesho ove linga vavipuise via vipi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Muomu vumuene vua Njambi keti ngue vunapu vuakulia na kunua houe, vuno honi vunapu vua vusunga na ciyulo na kujolela mu Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Kaha nga mupangela Kilistu mu ngila eyi vene, muvuahelesa Njambi, kaha na vantu vamitsiliela naua.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Nankuma, ntsimbu yoshe tunapande kusinganieka ha viuma vineha ciyulo navije vikuasa kukolesa umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Keti unongese vipangi via Njambi muomu ha viakulia lika. Viakulia vioshe viapua viakulela, vuno honi keti muacili kulia cuma cimo cije casa kulingisa umo linga auile mu vupi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Cuma cacili kulinga cinapu keti mulie ntsitu na kunua viniu, cipue kulinga cuma cimo cije citsuntsuisa mukueni. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Lutsilielo luje lu muli nalio lutulikeni hakati keni vavenia na Njambi, naku kuisula muntu uje kevu shuamua omo apanga cuma cimo cije namono nguendi cacili! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Vuno honi nga vakevo valina vimpata hali vije vialia, kaha Njambi navahisa laja omo vavilia, muomu vilinga viavo ku viakundamene ha lutsilielo. Muomu cuma coshe cije kucakundamene ha lutsilielo cinapu vupi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Vuaheleseni vakueni keti yeni vavenia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Yetu vaje vanakolo mu lutsilielo tunapande kukuasa vaje kanda vakole mu lutsilielo ha kuvakuasa kuambata viteli viavo. Kutuapandele kulivuahelesa yetu vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Vuno honi tuva voshe tunapande kuvuahelesa vakuetu mukuvalingila viacili, linga vakole mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Muomu Kilistu kalivuahelesele ikeye vavenia houe. Vuno honi ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Kushaula kuje kuvamishauile kuneja hali yange.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Viuma vioshe vije vanasoneka mu visoneka vavisonekele linga vitulongese, linga tusimpe na kulikolesa cije civanatuhana mu visoneka linga tukale nakutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Kaha Njambi uje ikeye ntsina ya kusimpa na kukolesa, amihane kuyoya vuino mukati keni umo na mukuavo kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />linga mu voshe mukashangazale Njambi Ishe ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na lizi limo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Nankuma, litambuleni umo namukuavo, ngue muanamitambula Kilistu, linga muhane vumpau kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Muomu njimileka nguange Kilistu vamupuisile muka kupangela Vayunda, mukumuesa ngue Njambi uapua ua vusunga, mukulingisa vikulaheso viendi kuli vakukuluila vavo linga vipue via vusunga, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kaha naua mukulingisa vaje keti Vayunda linga vashangazale Njambi ha cikeketima cendi. Ngue muvana visoneka muvisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Nankuma, njikakushangazala hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">njikemba nakukushangazala.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kaha naua nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Yeni vaje keti Vayunda joleleni hamo na vantu va Njambi!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kaha naua nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Shangazaleni Muene, yeni voshe vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">mushangazaleni yeni vantu voshe!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kaha naua Isaya ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Mutekuluila ua Njesi akasholoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">akeja mukuyula vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">kaha vakahaka kutsiliela cavo muli ikeye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Kaha Njambi, uje ntsina ya kutsiliela, amishulise na kuvuahelela coshe na ciyulo muomu ha lutsilielo lueni muli ikeye, linga kutsiliela ceni citualeleleho kukola na nzili ya Cimbembesi Uakulela.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muomu vikahoni Paulu ua vasonekelele na kusimpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Vamuanetu, yange vavenia njinamono nguange muavusunga yeni munashulu na vucili, kaha muli na mana oshe, kaha naua muasa kulilongesa umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Vuno honi mu mukanda ou njinasimpi ha kusoneka viuma vimo njamianukisa. Njinasimpi muomu ha kapandi kaje kananjihana Njambi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ha kupua ngamba ua Kilistu Yesu hakupangela vaje keti Vayunda. Njilinakupanga ngue kasasendote mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi, linga vaje keti Vayunda vapue nkombelo yakuvatambula kuli Njambi, ije ivanalelesa kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Muvumo muli Kilistu Yesu, njasa kulihalesa hakupangela Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Muomu njikasimpa nakuhandeka lika vije vianalingi Kilistu kuhitila muli yange mukutuamenena vaje keti Vayunda linga vononoke Njambi. Nalingi evi mu mezi na vilinga, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />na nzili ya vikomoueso na vizivukiso, na nzili ya Cimbembesi ua Njambi. Nankuma, kuhuma ku Yelusalema na kuheta ku Ilikiume, njinamanesa kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Cizango cange ntsimbu yoshe cinapu kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mu mitambela ije kanda vovue via Kilistu, kuteua njikatungila ha luvula luanahindi laja muntu ueka. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Vaje kuvavalekele via hali ikeye vakamumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">kaha vaje kuvevuile, vakevuisisa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua Paulu vuakuya ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kaha evi vikevo vianjihonouesele vintsimbu viavingi kuija kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Vuno honi omo njamanesa vipangi viange mu vihela evi, kaha njatondele ha miaka yayingi linga njije njakumimone, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />njinatsiliela kulinga ngoco vene. Njitonda kumimona ha vungenzi vuange vuakuya ku Sepeine, linga muakunjikuase hakuya kuje, kaha njikahandeke neni mu matangua amandende lika. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kaha hano vene njili nakuya ku Yelusalema nakupangela vantu va Njambi kuje. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Muomu vikungulukilo viamu Masendoniya na mu Akaya vanasinganieka kuhanako mulambu mukukuasa vihutu hakati ka vantu va Njambi mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Viapuile visinganieka viavo vavenia lika, vuno honi cilivene ha cuma eci, vakevo vakele na likongo lia kuvakuasa. Muomu Vayunda valipangelele vikuisulo viavo via cimbembesi na vaje keti Vayunda, kaha vaje keti Vayunda vanapande kupangesa vikuisulo viavo via vufuko mukukuasa Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Omo njinamanesa vipangi evi nakuneha vimbongo vioshe kuli vakevo vije vivana vakunguluila, kaha njikaya ku Sepeine nakumisikamesa ha vungenzi vuange vua kuya kuje. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Kaha omo njikeja kuli yeni, njazivuka nguange njikeja nakushula ca vikuisulo via Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Njimilambelela vamuanetu, kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na kuhitila mu cizango ca Cimbembesi, lipandakaneni hamo nange mukunjilombelela cikuma kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Lombeleni linga njikahone kukala na vushonde kuli vakakuhona kutsiliela mu Yundeya, kaha naua vipangi viange mu Yelusalema vakavitambule ku vantu va Njambi vaje vali muje. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Nankuma, njikeja kuli yeni nakuvuahelela coshe, nga cinapu cizango ca Njambi, na kuvuahelela mukumisikamesa. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Kaha Njambi, ntsina ya ciyulo, akale neni voshe. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Vihindu via Paulu ku vantu va mu Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Njikundika muanetu uampuevo Fuivi kuli yeni, uje muka kupangela cikungulukilo ca ku Senkili. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mutambuleni mu lizina lia Muene ngue muje muvakalingi vantu va Njambi, kaha mukuaseni vioshe vije atonda kuli yeni, muomu ikeye uapua kavusamba uacili ku vantu vavengi na kuli yange naua.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Vihindu kuli Pilisila na Akuila, vaje vaka kupanga nange mu vipangi via Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />vakevo vecelele muono uavo muomu yange. Njatsantsela, keti yange lika, vuno honi naua na vikungulukilo vioshe via vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Vihindu naua ku cikungulukilo ca vaje vakakungulukila mu njivo yavo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Vihindu kuli kavusamba uange Epaenetase, uje uapuile yala uakulivanga kutsiliela muli Kilistu mu nganda ya Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Vihindu kuli Maliya, uje uamipangelele cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Vihindu naua kuli Andolonikase na Njuniyase, vakuetu Vayunda vaje mutuakelele mu kamenga, vapua vakutsimana hakati ka tunganda, kaha vapuile vaka Kilistu ntsimbu kanda yange njitsiliele.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Vihindu viange kuli Ampiliatase, kavusamba uange ha kulitombola muli Muene. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Vihindu naua kuli Ambanase, mukuetu mu vipangi via Kilistu, na kuli Sitacise kavusamba uange ua cizango. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Vihindu kuli Apelese, uje kulongua cendi muli Kilistu vanacishangala. Vihindu kuli vaje vanakundama ku ntanga ya Alisitombolase. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Vihindu kuli Helondione, mukuetu Kayunda, na kuli vaka Kilistu mu ntanga ya Nasisase.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Vihindu viange kuli Talafaena na kuli Talafosa vaje vapanga mu vipangi via Muene, na kuli kavusamba uange Pelesise, uje napanga cikuma vipangi via Muene. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Vihindu kuli Lufase, uje uakuhangula muli Muene, hamo na vaina vaje vakele nakunjiniunga ngue nji munavo. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Vihindu kuli Asinikilitase na Felengone na Helemese na Patolombase na Helemase na vamuanetu voshe vaje vali hamo navo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Vihindu kuli Filolongese na Njuniyase na Neliase na munaina uampuevo, na kuli Olimpase na ku vantu voshe va Njambi vaje vali hamo navo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Kaha lihinduiseni umo na mukuavo nakulitsemba cakulela. Vikungulukilo vioshe via Kilistu vanamimeneka.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa viakumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Njimilomba vamuanetu nguange, zangameni kuli vaje vaneha kulihangununa nakutanganesa lutsilielo lua vantu nakuluisa vilongesa vije vimuatambuile. Vashondolokeni! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kaha omo voshe vaje valinga viuma evi, kuvesi nakupangela Kilistu Muene uetu vuno honi vali nakupangela lika mazimo avo, kaha na mezi avo akukokueya na handekesi yavo yakuzembeleka vakuise vantu vakuhona mulonga.<verse eid="ROM 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Omo vantu voshe vanovu kulongua ceni ku Muzimbu Uacili kaha ha cuma eci njili nakuvuahelela cikuma hali yeni. Njitonda nguange mupue vaka mana ku viuma viacili, vuno honi pueni vakakuhona mulonga ku viuma via vupi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Kaha Njambi ua ciyulo, vuavuno akatsena Satana muintsi ya viliato viendi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu kakale hamo neni.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Mukuetu Timateo muvipangi, alinakumihana vihindu, na Lusiyasi na Njasone na Sosipata vakuetu Vayunda.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Kaha yange Teshase muka kusoneka mukanda ou njamitumu vihindu muli Muene.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ngayase, muka kunjijumbula, uje mu njivo yendi cikungulukilo cikaliuanena, na Elasitase uje mukakutulika cikuama ca nganda, na muanetu Kuatase, vanatumu vihindu viavo kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Ciyulo ca Muene Yesu Kilistu cikale neni. Ameni<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia kumamanusuilo lia vishangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nankuma vumpau vukale kuli Njambi! Ikeye asa kumipangesa linga mukolese mu lutsilielo lueni, kuya ku Muzimbu Uacili njikambulula via Yesu Kilistu, nakuya kukusholola ca vusunga vuakushueka vuje vuvashuekele hume laja. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Vuno honi vuje vusunga vanavunehe hambanza mutania muelu muvisoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi, nakushika ca Njambi ua miaka yoshe vana vuzivukisa kuli vaje keti Vayunda voshe, linga voshe vatsiliele nakuononoka.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kuli Njambi umo lika uje ua mana oshe, kukale vumpau kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>